OL,3,GNEWSAOver 1,000 tonnes of sewage seen
OL,4,Aat landfill site
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 tonnes of "sewage
OL,7,Fsludge" have been seen at a landfill
OL,8,Fsite near Doncaster, according to an MP
OL,9,Ffor the town.
OL,11,FLee Pitcher said in a Facebook post he
OL,12,Fhad been told the waste was being
OL,13,Fstored in "an uncovered stockpile" at
OL,14,Fthe site in Finningley.
OL,16,FThe Labour MP said he had been in
OL,17,Fcontact with the Environment Agency
OL,18,F(EA), which confirmed on Thursday that
OL,19,Fit had "set out a series of actions"
OL,20,Ffor the site's operator following an
OL,21,Finspection.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
