OL,3,GNEWSAOver 1,000 tonnes of sewage seen
OL,4,Aat landfill site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe landfill, located in a former
OL,7,Fquarry, is operated by Tetron
OL,8,FFinningley Ltd, which has not
OL,9,Fpreviously responded when contacted for
OL,10,Fcomment by the BBC.
